  "caption": "Cantonese soft rock, late-1970s AOR-style love song. Clean chorused electric guitar arpeggios; Rhodes electric piano comping; warm fretless bass; a soft, roomy kick-and-snare kit with gentle ride; a low Hammond organ pad under the choruses and a short melodic guitar solo. Gentle tape saturation, warm and unhurried. Male baritone, soft and close in verses, opening up warmly in the chorus. 76 BPM, D major. Tender, shy and quietly delighted. No autotune, no trap beat, no EDM synths, no orchestral swell, no distorted guitars.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n鴨寮街個地攤\n我買咗盞舊銅燈\n燈罩就冇咗\n老闆話下個禮拜有\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n星期六我再落去\n見到你企喺檔口\n\n[Chorus]\n你都買咗同一盞燈\n你都等緊個燈罩\n老闆得返一個\n佢望住我哋笑\n\n[Verse]\n你話你盞擺喺床頭\n我話我盞擺書枱\n兩盞都係銅色\n底座都刻住個福字\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我話燈罩你攞去\n你話咁點得㗎\n\n[Chorus]\n我哋買咗同一盞燈\n只係得一個罩\n你話不如輪住用\n一個禮拜一間屋\n\n[Verse]\n我哋飲咗杯凍檸茶\n傾到街燈都着晒\n你寫低你個地址\n話星期日輪到我\n\n[Bridge]\n燈罩喺你嗰度\n我盞燈冇罩都唔怕\n\n[Chorus]\n我哋有同一盞燈\n燈罩就喺中間行\n今晚我開燈嗰陣\n諗住你都開緊\n\n[Outro]\n兩盞銅燈\n一個燈罩",
